 "contents": "CK-3X Mk3 flight deck: 40-facet white chamfered panel liner on the IML facets (20 mm, 8 mm seams) over the dark pressure-vessel liner, panelled aft / nose bulkheads, LED inlays; tiled flight deck (iva deck plane, Godot z -1.05); 2 pilot seats (mq01 command seats with hand controllers / keypad) and 2 systems seats (mq00) on graphite seat bases; glass-cockpit main panel (6 MFDs with backlit bezel keys, guarded switch strip, black glare shield); centre pedestal (2-lever throttle quadrant, FMS display, switch plate); overhead panel (3 switch rows) with LED wash strip; rudder pedals; systems stations (2 large wall displays forward of the hatches); +X / -X crew hatches (coaming, seal, door trim, handle, valve, hinge fairings), 2 hatch steps + 4 handrails; 6 windows (5 upper band + overhead docking window) with tight black bezels and inner panes; extinguisher, first aid",
 "notes": [
  "frame: crew posture gravity Godot -Z (aircraft level flight; the iva deck and the 0.67 m SRP height confirm it); the request said -Y gravity -> see the B9 frame flag",
  "R3: rear row moved aft (seats 3/4 Godot y -1.59), second side hatch (hatch_2, -X) added, both hatches between the rows (y -1.02): steps / handrails on both sides, the systems displays moved forward of the hatches, the -X systems console removed (hatch_2 opens there); extinguisher / first aid on the aft bulkhead",
  "deck: liner panels / end-wall tiles crossing the deck plane are cut flush with the deck tile tops (v5 deck cutter)",
  "deck: iva deck plane CAD y 1.05 = Godot z -1.05 -> 15 mm tread tiles on a dark deck plate; liner bands entirely below the deck are not panelled (bilge)",
  "pilot seats = mq01 command seats (dual hand controllers act as the sidesticks, swing-in keypad); throttle quadrant (2 levers) on the centre pedestal",
  "windows 1-5 (upper band): tight bezels opened toward the pilot eyes (node_camera_1/2); overhead docking window 6: toward the systems eyes (node_camera_3/4); furniture clipped out of those sight cones"
 ],
